Fixed the fat menu stories rendering out of position and unstyled. The panel is absolutely positioned against the menu item that triggers it, so it needs the `.desktop-menu` list and an item with width; the open state is signalled by an `active` class, which two decorators had spelled differently. Every story is now also constrained to the default container width and centred, with an opt-out for the views and header that genuinely span the page. @ericof
